  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Diesel-driven disruptions to inland trucking, container drayage and short-sea shipping delay delivery of GPU/server hardware and spare parts, immediately reducing allocable compute in affected regions.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
