  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rapid improvements in tactical and decision-support AI shorten sensor-to-shooter cycles and reduce manpower/risk for maritime and air probing operations, lowering the operational cost of conducting complex gray-zone coercive maneuvers and thus increasing their frequency/intensity.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
