  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharp, visible advances in AI capabilities drive large new equity and private capital rounds concentrated in US/China tech firms, prompting portfolio managers and allocators to pull capital out of European bond and equity markets and send net flows toward those tech hubs.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_ai_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">eurozone_bond_stress</data>
</edge>
