  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">A rise in cyber operations targeting AI models, cloud infrastructure, and maritime/air C2 pushes military planners to accelerate procurement, hardening, and redundant integration of defense systems, raising the pace of capability build-out.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
