  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased hostile cyber operations tied to US–China rivalry that target European financial infrastructure cause outages, fraud losses and confidence shocks that strain bank liquidity, trigger higher funding costs and raise solvency concerns.</data>
