  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An uptick in cyber operations tied to US–China AI competition spills into maritime cyber effects (AIS/GPS spoofing, port IT compromises) in the Red Sea/Gulf area, producing operational disruptions and losses that drive insurers and charterers to demand higher risk premia for fuel shipments.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_ai_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_houthi_maritime</data>
