  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">A rise in targeted cyber operations against industrial control systems and IT at refineries and terminals can directly force units offline and reduce throughput by causing shutdowns, safety trips, or persistent operational disruption.</data>
