<edge source="iran_houthi_maritime::shipping_risk_premium" target="china_taiwan_grayzone::investor_risk_premium" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher maritime shipping risk premiums immediately raise costs, margins uncertainty and insurance exposure for firms trading across the Taiwan Strait and regional supply chains, causing investors to demand higher risk premia on China- and Taiwan-exposed assets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_houthi_maritime</data>
  <data key="d39">china_taiwan_grayzone</data>
</edge>
<edge source="iran_houthi_maritime::shipping_risk_premium" target="eurozone_bond_stress::market_volatility" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">A rise in the shipping risk premium increases uncertainty in oil, freight and insurance costs, triggering rapid repricing of energy-linked instruments and derivatives and driving up realized and implied volatility across European fixed‑income and related markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-3 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_houthi_maritime</data>
  <data key="d39">eurozone_bond_stress</data>
</edge>
<edge source="iran_houthi_maritime::shipping_risk_premium" target="russia_ukraine_war::diesel_price_level" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising insurance, war-risk and freight premia for tanker voyages are passed into delivered fuel costs, quickly lifting benchmark diesel prices across major trading hubs.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_houthi_maritime</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="iran_houthi_maritime::shipping_risk_premium" target="us_china_ai_rivalry::cyber_attack_activity" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising shipping insurance premiums signal escalating maritime confrontation and incentivize state and proxy actors to launch cyber operations against adversary logistics, port, and cloud infrastructures (including AI toolchains) to exploit or exacerbate supply‑chain stress.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_houthi_maritime</data>
