  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising eurozone sovereign spreads raise government borrowing costs and fiscal pressure, prompting postponement of planned purchases or refilling of national strategic fuel stocks and/or sales of reserve inventories to cover budgets, thereby lowering reserve levels.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">eurozone_bond_stress</data>
