  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained rise in sovereign credit spreads raises borrowing costs and valuation pressure for European carriers and data‑centre operators, prompting capex delays or cancellations that reduce available installed/allocable compute capacity accessible to global AI workloads.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
