  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A rapid defense procurement and production push reallocates semiconductors, accelerators, and manufacturing capacity toward military systems and prompts export controls/prioritization, reducing the compute capacity available for civilian and commercial AI use (especially to rival actors).</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_taiwan_grayzone</data>
