  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising geopolitical risk premia make investors less willing to fund long‑horizon, capital‑intensive AI model development in exposed firms and jurisdictions, slowing project scale‑ups and therefore the pace of model capability improvement.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_taiwan_grayzone</data>
